"22. A pressure vessel fitness-for-service (FFS) assessment per API 579 Level 2 is requested for a vessel with a local thinned area (LTA) of 85 mm × 120 mm. The original wall thickness is 25 mm, measured thickness in the LTA is 14.5 mm, and minimum required thickness is 12.5 mm. The assessment method uses the MAWP at the corroded thickness. What is the Level 2 assessment decision criterion?",
