"24. During a storage tank API 653 inspection, the floor shows MFL (magnetic flux leakage) indications at 25% of the floor area. The MFL report classifies the worst indications as 'Severity 4' (>80% wall loss). The tank floor nominal plate thickness is 6 mm. Minimum required thickness per API 653 is 3.8 mm. What is the assessment for a Severity 4 indication?",
