"13. An API 653 internal tank inspection finds extensive underside pitting on the bottom annular plate with pit depths up to 4 mm on a 6 mm original plate (2 mm remaining at worst pit). API 653 minimum for this plate is 3.8 mm. Develop a complete repair plan including temporary protection measures, repair method selection, inspection during repair, and re-commissioning procedure.",
